                                "sense_id": "7cd6d4c8-cacb-33ab-b4f8-f919976bfe44",
                                "text": "The German folklorism discourse unraveled the dichotomous premise underlying the definition of folklore that had confined true folklore to communal, preferably peasant settings and excluded materials and groups tainted by the forces of modernity, such as industry or media."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
